{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Brothel Manager</i> is an adult-themed business sim game. As a god-like manager, you\u2019ll start small, serving the least demanding clients and building only the bare essentials. As your reputation grows, more exotic and demanding guests will arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/d7748382af4b98feaad17ad63eaba798.poster.avif?t=1755766829\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/d7748382af4b98feaad17ad63eaba798.webm?t=1755766829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/d7748382af4b98feaad17ad63eaba798.mp4?t=1755766829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, magical creatures will appear, offering great rewards and even greater risks. Can a displeased ghost possess your staff? Can a furious Ifrit reduce your business to ashes? Sure! So, better use everything at your hand, including magic, to make them happy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/b940bd49d02fcffc09c22869409d9793.poster.avif?t=1755766829\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/b940bd49d02fcffc09c22869409d9793.webm?t=1755766829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555680/extras/b940bd49d02fcffc09c22869409d9793.mp4?t=1755766829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://sto